 "story5": {
  "example": "When the tickets arrived, Zoe called her best friend and sounded so enthusiastic that he had to hold the phone away from his ear. At the game, her team lost badly in the pouring rain, but she stayed enthusiastic. The next morning at work, she could barely act enthusiastic, until her boss showed her the newspaper: Zoe, cheering alone in the rain, was on the front page.",
